  "details": "The VRCAVProVideoScreen component will only set the _MainTex property on a material regardless of what you put in the Texture Property field for a name. \nMake a video screen with the example Udon Sync Player (AVPro) and use Standard shader, enable realtime emission and choose _EmissionMap for the property name. It will set the _MainTex property instead. Choose some random name like \"aaaaaaaa\" as the property name, it will still choose the _MainTex property.",
